 # Million.js

 **Million.js** is an extremely fast and lightweight (`<4kb`) virtual DOM that makes [React components](https://react.dev) up to [**70% faster**](https://krausest.github.io/js-framework-benchmark/current.html).
@@ -31,41 +27,3 @@ If you're just looking into trying out Million.js, you can follow guided example
